<p>Don't feel the need to rebuild it from scratch! It's doing pretty well in terms of votes, and don't let the length of my comment fool you: I'm just one person, listing one person's set of criticisms.</p>
<p>I see you're hung up on logic. I get obsessed with whether my pieces make sense when put under a microscope too. We shouldn't be. Barely anyone notices if your writing contains some minor logical flaw. After all, how many movies become blockbuster successes with nine-figure profits despite being riddled with plot holes? If you're writing and come across a toss-up between logic and impact, err on the side of the latter.</p>

